  "features": [
    "Histogram options require objects, safe integers for numeric bounds, signed-int64 bounds for BigInts, integral figures and exact highest >= 2 * lowest comparison.",
    "BigInt bounds reach the native constructor without conversion through Number; native conversion supports both immediate and heap BigInts.",
    "Existing pinned exact-extrema and BigInt-percentile semantics remain unchanged."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The Node control agrees on validation and int64 acceptance, while Node reports HDR bucket extrema. An initial exploratory equality assertion exposed this difference and is recorded in control-limitations.txt; no universal Node-equivalence claim is made.",
    "Histogram record numeric/range behavior beyond this batch, measured utilization/startup counters, full resource/observer semantics, complete Bun suite and Release/ASAN/all-platform verification remain open under #869 and #66.",
    "The previous broad process scope still retains the ICU assertion contradiction in #872; this selected green scope does not clear it."
  ],
